Being part of the Anchoring Club at VIT has been a fulfilling and transformative experience, allowing me to embrace my passion for public speaking and design. As both an anchor and a member of the design domain, I’ve had the privilege of contributing to events that bring creativity and energy to life. One of the highlights of my journey was anchoring one of the largest collaborations of VIT’s cultural clubs - a moment that challenged and honed my stage presence and communication skills.

Beyond anchoring, my involvement in the design domain allows me to merge creativity with strategy, crafting visuals that enhance the impact of our events. I am constantly striving to refine my anchoring and stage skills, using every opportunity to grow more confident and articulate. Whether it’s engaging with an audience, designing impactful materials, or collaborating with like-minded peers, the Anchoring Club has provided me with a platform to develop and express my multifaceted talents.
